  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Non-repayable support (Grants) - multi-annual work programme of pillar I for the years 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this Action is to approve the full financing of non-repayable support to the Ukraine Plan under pillar I of the Ukraine Facility in the form of a multi-annual financing decision 2024-2027.This follows the Regulation (EU) 2024/792 establishing the Ukraine Facility adopted on 29 February 2024 and the submission of the Ukraine Plan on 20 March 2024 which was adopted by the Council Implementing Decision (EU) 2024/1447 of 14 May 2024.</narrative>
  </description>
